    "posts": [
      {
        "id": 10217,
        "name": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "username": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-25T13:27:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fun Fact: If you combine Iron Legacy and Plague Rat, you can build an unstoppable damage machine of doom. Use the two&nbsp;<em>Demoralising Presence</em>s,&nbsp;<em>Galvanised&nbsp;</em>and two copies of&nbsp;<em>Shadowy Ambush</em>&nbsp;as your H starting ongoings (as Iron Legacy) and fill the rest of the deck with cards that hit all heroes for 2 or more damage:</p><ul>\n<li><span>Vicious Onslaught x2 - 8 hits for 5 damage each.</span></li>\n<li><span>Ravage x2: 4 hits for 5 damage each.</span></li>\n<li><span>Rule From The Front x2: 5 hits of 7 damage each.</span></li>\n<li><span>Flying Assault x3: 4 hits of 7 damage each.</span></li>\n<li>Sun's Fury x2: 5 hits of 5 damage each.</li>\n<li>Mass Overheating x2: 5 hits of 5 damage each.</li>\n<li>Hasten Doom x4: 5 hits of 5 damage each (plus a card play).</li>\n<li>Devious Disruption x2: 5 hits of 6 damage each.</li>\n<li>\"Consider The Price of Victory: 5 hits of 5 damage each.</li>\n</ul><p>The first card play triggers n x 2 card plays, where n is the number of hits it inflicts; each further card then triggers n x 2 more card plays. Now this can only go on until the deck runs out, but the deck will be run out on the first instance of damage from each card; then the 19th card will play that card (n x 2) - 1 more times, then the 18th card will play (n x 2) - 1 more 19th cards... Oh, and then at the end of the round Iron Legacy deals everyone 6 damage and triggered this&nbsp;<em>ten more times</em>.</p><p>The total number of hits inflicted by 20th cards will be something like 1.2 x 10^20 (or 100,000,000,000,000,000,000); each hit is for about 5 damage, so that's 6 x 10^20, and the chain is done 11 times, so 6.6 x 10^21.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I do not plan to use this deck. Ever.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:12.258Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
