.. Oh, and then at the end of the round Iron Legacy deals everyone 6 damage and triggered this&nbsp;<em style=\"font-size: 13px;\">ten more times</em>.</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">The total number of hits inflicted by 20th cards will be something like 1.2 x 10^20 (or 100,000,000,000,000,000,000); each hit is for about 5 damage, so that&#39;s 6 x 10^20, and the chain is done 11 times, so 6.6 x 10^21.</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">I do not plan to use this deck. Ever.</p>",
